OL,3,GNEWSAPete Waterman targets 'almost
OL,4,Aimpossible' cancer cure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA legendary music producer whose son
OL,7,Fdied of brain cancer has said there
OL,8,Fneeds to be more of a focus on finding
OL,9,Fa cure.
OL,11,FPete Waterman's son Paul died in 2005
OL,12,Fat the age of 33, and the producer who
OL,13,Fhelped launch the music careers of
OL,14,FKylie Minogue, Jason Donovan and Rick
OL,15,FAstley, believes he had an aggressive
OL,16,Fbrain tumour known as glioblastoma.
