OL,3,GNEWSAPete Waterman targets 'almost
OL,4,Aimpossible' cancer cure
OL,5,
OL,6,FWaterman, from Coventry, is now a
OL,7,Fpatron of Brain Tumour Research and on
OL,8,Fa visit to its research laboratory in
OL,9,FNottingham on Wednesday he said he did
OL,10,Fnot want anyone else to go through what
OL,11,Fhe did.
OL,13,FThe government announced the same day
OL,14,Fit was taking steps to speed up turning
OL,15,Fbrain cancer research into treatment.
